  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Horti visit to CII Krishi Bharat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In November 2024 the Netherlands embassy in New Delhi, India participated in the CII Krishi Bharat in Lucknow, by organising a pavilion where the innovative approach of protected cultivation in horticulture will be one of the focus areas.Next to the pavilion, knowledge sessions on the Netherlands in general and the sector in particular, will be organised and match making will take place for the participating business delegation.This project is part of the combi-track Horticulture in India that focuses on South and West India. It will contribute to the pillar &apos;Business-to-Business (B2B) Mid- &amp; High-Tech Opportunities&apos;, and therefore aims to contribute to better B2B relations in this sector exploring partnership projects in protected cultivation with Indian (smallholder) farmers and agri-entrepreneurs.</narrative>
  </description>
